                   underperform attention by up to 2.1 perplexity points on the
                   Pile. In fine-grained analysis, we find 82\% of the gap is
                   explained by each model's ability to recall information that
                   is previously mentioned in-context, e.g. ``Hakuna Matata
                   means no worries Hakuna Matata it means no'' $\rightarrow$
