  abstract      = "Can we recover the hidden parameters of an Artificial Neural
                   Network (ANN) by probing its input-output mapping? We propose
                   a systematic method, called `Expand-and-Cluster' that needs
                   only the number of hidden layers and the activation function
                   of the probed ANN to identify all network parameters. In the
