  journal       = "arXiv [cond-mat.stat-mech]",
  abstract      = "We report a similarity between the microscopic parameter
                   dependance of emergent theories in physics and that of
                   multiparameter models common in other areas of science. In
                   both cases, predictions are possible despite large
                   uncertainties in the microscopic parameters because these
                   details are compressed into just a few governing parameters
