  journal       = "arXiv [q-bio.NC]",
  abstract      = "Neural activity fluctuates over a wide range of timescales
                   within and across brain areas. Experimental observations
                   suggest that diverse neural timescales reflect information in
                   dynamic environments. However, how timescales are defined and
