  volume    =  166,
  number    =  1,
  pages     = "245--257",
  abstract  = "A mechanistic understanding of neural computation requires
               determining how information is processed as it passes through
               neurons and across synapses. However, it has been challenging to
               measure membrane potential changes in axons and dendrites in
               vivo. We use in vivo, two-photon imaging of novel genetically
               encoded voltage indicators, as well as calcium imaging, to
