  journal  = "bioRxivorg",
  abstract = "The fruit fly Drosophila melanogaster combines surprisingly
              sophisticated behaviour with a highly tractable nervous system. A
              large part of the fly's success as a model organism in modern
              neuroscience stems from the concentration of collaboratively
              generated molecular genetic and digital resources. As presented in
