  publisher = "eLife Sciences Publications, Ltd",
  volume    =  8,
  abstract  = "Seeking new insights into the homeostasis, modulation and
               plasticity of cortical synaptic networks, we have analyzed
               results from a single-cell RNA-seq study of 22,439 mouse
               neocortical neurons. Our analysis exposes transcriptomic evidence
               for dozens of molecularly distinct neuropeptidergic modulatory
