  booktitle = "Forty-first International Conference on Machine Learning",
  abstract  = "Deep neural networks based on linear RNNs interleaved with
               position-wise MLPs are gaining traction as competitive approaches
               for sequence modeling. Examples of such architectures include
               state-space models (SSMs) like S4, LRU, and Mamba: recently
               proposed models that achieve promising performance on text,
               genetics, and other data that require long-range reasoning.
