                   apply state-of-the-art SBI methods to black-box simulators,
                   opening up new possibilities for aligning simulations with
                   empirically observed data.",
  month         =  nov,
  year          =  2024,
  archivePrefix = "arXiv",
  primaryClass  = "cs.LG"
}

@ARTICLE{Vishwanathan2024-xb,
