  number    =  2,
  pages     = "250--257",
  abstract  = "A neuron that extracts directionally selective motion information
               from upstream signals lacking this selectivity must compare
               visual responses from spatially offset inputs. Distinguishing
               among prevailing algorithmic models for this computation requires
               measuring fast neuronal activity and inhibition. In the
