              parameter tuning framework capable of tuning SNNs quickly and
              efficiently using evolutionary algorithms (EA) and inexpensive,
              readily accessible graphics processing units (GPUs). A sample SNN
              with 4104 neurons was tuned to give V1 simple cell-like tuning
