  number   =  2,
  pages    = "872--890",
  abstract = "Biophysically accurate multicompartmental models of individual
              neurons have significantly advanced our understanding of the
              input-output function of single cells. These models depend on a
              large number of parameters that are difficult to estimate. In
              practice, they are often hand-tuned to match measured
