              regenerative dendritic events. However, owing to the difficulty of
              performing functional recordings from place cell dendrites, no
              direct evidence of regenerative dendritic events exists, leaving
              any possible connection to place coding unknown. Using multi-plane
              two-photon calcium imaging of CA1 place cell somata, axons and
              dendrites in mice navigating a virtual environment, here we show
