              presynaptic inputs are typically observed. Here we use in vitro
              current injection in layer 2/3 pyramidal neurons to validate
              methods for inferring functional connectivity in a setting where
              input to the neuron is controlled. In experiments with
              partially-defined input, we inject a single simulated input with
