  author   = "Zaytsev, Yury V and Morrison, Abigail",
  journal  = "Front. Neuroinform.",
  volume   =  8,
  pages    =  23,
  abstract = "NEST is a simulator for large-scale networks of spiking point
              neuron models (Gewaltig and Diesmann, 2007). Originally,
              simulations were controlled via the Simulation Language
              Interpreter (SLI), a built-in scripting facility implementing a
