              branches. In this contribution we present the re-implementation of
              PyNEST in the Cython language, a superset of Python that
              additionally supports the declaration of C/C++ types for variables
              and class attributes, and provides a convenient foreign function
              interface (FFI) for invoking C/C++ routines (Behnel et al., 2011).
              Code generation via Cython allows the production of smaller and
