  volume    =  551,
  number    =  7679,
  pages     = "232--236",
  abstract  = "Sensory, motor and cognitive operations involve the coordinated
               action of large neuronal populations across multiple brain
               regions in both superficial and deep structures. Existing
               extracellular probes record neural activity with excellent
               spatial and temporal (sub-millisecond) resolution, but from only
