  pages     = "312--322",
  abstract  = "The goal of dynamic causal modelling (DCM) of neuroimaging data
               is to study experimentally induced changes in functional
               integration among brain regions. This requires (i) biophysically
               plausible and physiologically interpretable models of neuronal
               network dynamics that can predict distributed brain responses to
