  author   = "Ding, Zhiwei and Tran, Dat T and Ponder, Kayla and Cobos, Erick
              and Ding, Zhuokun and Fahey, Paul G and Wang, Eric and Muhammad,
              Taliah and Fu, Jiakun and Cadena, Santiago A and Papadopoulos,
