                   model discovery, we establish an in silico testbed using
                   neuromechanical simulations of a larval zebrafish as a
                   transparent ground truth. We find that LLM-based tree search
                   autonomously discovers predictive models that significantly
                   outperform established forecasting baselines. Conditioning on
