  volume    =  13,
  abstract  = "Understanding brain function relies on the collective work of
               many labs generating reproducible results. However,
               reproducibility has not been systematically assessed within the
               context of electrophysiological recordings during cognitive
               behaviors. To address this, we formed a multi-lab collaboration
