  volume    =  13,
  number    =  8,
  pages     = "973--978",
  abstract  = "In the visual system of Drosophila, photoreceptors R1-R6 relay
               achromatic brightness information to five parallel pathways. Two
               of them, the lamina monopolar cells L1 and L2, represent the
               major input lines to the motion detection circuitry. We devised a
               new method for optical recording of visually evoked changes in
